/************************ START OF SPECIFICATIONS ***************************/
/*                                                                          */
/* SOURCE FILE NAME:  CONTROL.SCR for the ESS AudioDrive 1869               */
/*                                                                          */
/* DESCRIPTIVE NAME:  Master control file                                   */
